schema: "0.3"
id: echo-of-manifestation-marketing-store-screenshots
type: image
service: gemini

prompt:
  text: >
    Dark fantasy concept art showing 4 store screenshot concepts for "Echo of Manifestation",
    arranged in a 2x2 grid, each panel labeled with a number in the corner. Each screenshot
    concept shows a different aspect of gameplay rendered in dark fantasy concept art style:

    PANEL 1 (Top-Left) — "CORE LOOP": The Survivor standing at an Alchemy Shrine transmutation
    station, one hand on the stone altar, the other holding an item above the transmutation
    circle. Essence flows like liquid mercury through the carved channels. To the right of the
    shrine, a Shadow Blade chimera is mid-manifestation — half-formed from the altar's shadow,
    its jagged sword-arm reaching toward the player. The scene captures the core tension:
    creating useful items spawns enemies. Amber light from the shrine, deep indigo shadows
    where the chimera forms. Label: "1" in bottom-left corner.

    PANEL 2 (Top-Right) — "BOSS FIGHT": The Survivor in combat with a zone boss — the
    Echoed Deacon — within the Faded Chapel. The Echoed Deacon is a massive corrupted
    church figure in ornate vestments, shadow pouring from its mitre, wielding a staff
    that is also a transmutation circle. The chapel interior surrounds them: dissolving
    pews, wrong stained glass, amber candlelight. The Survivor is mid-dodge, Essence Bow
    drawn, firing an amber arrow. Dynamic action composition, dramatic lighting. Label: "2"
    in bottom-left corner.

    PANEL 3 (Bottom-Left) — "COMPANION MOMENT": The Survivor and Echo in a quiet moment
    within a Time Dilation Pocket safe zone. Echo is pointing at a glowing lore fragment —
    a floating piece of parchment with alchemical text — while the Survivor reads from their
    journal. The crystalline bubble of the safe zone surrounds them, warm amber light inside,
    hostile indigo darkness outside. Intimate, story-driven composition. Label: "3" in
    bottom-left corner.

    PANEL 4 (Bottom-Right) — "ZONE VARIETY": A split-screen composition showing two zones
    side by side, divided by a thin amber line. LEFT HALF: The Sunken Market — flooded bazaar,
    teal bioluminescent underlighting, tarnished copper, shadow-water. RIGHT HALF: The
    Petrified Forest — obsidian trees, frozen falling leaves, amber moonlight shafts, absolute
    stillness. The Survivor appears small in each half, emphasizing environmental scale and
    variety. Label: "4" in bottom-left corner.

    Each panel should have a dark border separating it from the others. The overall grid
    should feel cohesive — same art style, palette, and quality across all four panels.
    Painterly style, dark fantasy, amber and deep indigo palette throughout.
  negative: "bright, cheerful, cartoon, anime, clean magic, actual screenshots, pixel art, photorealistic, colorful palette, simple mockup, low detail, flat shading, text-heavy"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1920
    height: 1080
    aspect_ratio: "16:9"

tags: [marketing, screenshots, store-page, gameplay-concepts, concept-art, dark-fantasy]
